    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s26-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p01.mp3",
      "en": "Salt has always been important to people.",
      "cn": "盐对人们来说一直很重要。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s26-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p02.mp3",
      "en": "In the past, it was as valuable as gold.",
      "cn": "在过去，它和黄金一样珍贵。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s26-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p03.mp3",
      "en": "People would trade for it.",
      "cn": "人们会拿东西去换盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s26-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p04.mp3",
      "en": "Over the years, people discovered different ways to get salt.",
      "cn": "多年来，人们发现了不同的方法来获取盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s26-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p05.mp3",
      "en": "Depending on the geography, some early people got salt from rocks.",
      "cn": "受地理环境影响，部分早期人类从岩石中获取盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s26-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p06.mp3",
      "en": "In other places, like on the islands, people got salt from the sea.",
      "cn": "在其他地方，比如岛屿上，人们则从海里获取盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s26-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p07.mp3",
      "en": "They took sea water and put it in the sun.",
      "cn": "他们取来海水，把它放在太阳下晒。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s26-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p08.mp3",
      "en": "After a long time, the water dried up.",
      "cn": "很长时间过去，水分蒸发了。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s26-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p09.mp3",
      "en": "Then people could get salt.",
      "cn": "然后人们就能获得盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s26-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p10.mp3",
      "en": "Sometimes they would boil the sea water in large pots to get salt faster.",
      "cn": "有时，他们还会把海水放在大锅里煮沸，以便更快获得盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s26-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p11.mp3",
      "en": "Today, people still get salt from the sea, but most salt comes from salt mines and salt wells.",
      "cn": "如今，人们仍然从海里获取盐，但大部分盐来自盐矿和盐井。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s26-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p12.mp3",
      "en": "They dig deep holes into the ground for salt.",
      "cn": "他们在地下挖深洞采盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s26-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p13.mp3",
      "en": "They also operate machines to aid themselves.",
      "cn": "他们还会操作机器来协助自己。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s26-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p14.mp3",
      "en": "To get salt from salt wells, people put two pipes into the ground.",
      "cn": "为了从盐井中获取食盐，人们把两根管子插入地下。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s26-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p15.mp3",
      "en": "Water is sent down through one of the pipes.",
      "cn": "水通过其中一根管子被注入地下。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s26-p16",
      "image": "assets/images/16.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p16.mp3",
      "en": "And the water is mixed with the salt in salt wells.",
      "cn": "水与盐井中的盐混合。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 17,
      "chunkId": "s26-p17",
      "image": "assets/images/17.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p17.mp3",
      "en": "It makes salt water.",
      "cn": "它形成盐水。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 18,
      "sourceSentenceId": 18,
      "chunkId": "s26-p18",
      "image": "assets/images/18.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p18.mp3",
      "en": "Then the salt water is pushed up through the other pipe.",
      "cn": "然后，盐水通过另一根管子被抽上来。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 19,
      "sourceSentenceId": 19,
      "chunkId": "s26-p19",
      "image": "assets/images/19.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p19.mp3",
      "en": "Later, the salt is taken out of the salt water.",
      "cn": "随后，再从盐水中提取出盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 20,
      "sourceSentenceId": 20,
      "chunkId": "s26-p20",
      "image": "assets/images/20.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p20.mp3",
      "en": "People once worked hard to find and make salt.",
      "cn": "人们曾经不辞辛劳地寻找和制造盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 21,
      "sourceSentenceId": 21,
      "chunkId": "s26-p21",
      "image": "assets/images/21.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p21.mp3",
      "en": "Now, people can buy it at any food store.",
      "cn": "现在，人们可以在任何一家食品店买到盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 22,
      "sourceSentenceId": 22,
      "chunkId": "s26-p22",
      "image": "assets/images/22.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p22.mp3",
      "en": "Salt is cheap and comes in packets or boxes.",
      "cn": "盐很便宜，有袋装或盒装的。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 23,
      "sourceSentenceId": 23,
      "chunkId": "s26-p23",
      "image": "assets/images/23.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p23.mp3",
      "en": "It is almost always there in the recipes you download online.",
      "cn": "你在网上下载的食谱中几乎都能看到盐。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 24,
      "sourceSentenceId": 24,
      "chunkId": "s26-p24",
      "image": "assets/images/24.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p24.mp3",
      "en": "You can use it when cooking noodles or making soup.",
      "cn": "你在煮面条或做汤时都可以用到它。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 25,
      "sourceSentenceId": 25,
      "chunkId": "s26-p25",
      "image": "assets/images/25.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s26-p25.mp3",
      "en": "It has become an important part of our everyday lives.",
      "cn": "盐已经成为我们日常生活中重要的一部分。"
    }
  ]
